      "content": "Hey, I'm the director of a large international NGO. We have a big donor gala coming up, but I'm getting a lot of pushback from people saying that sending money abroad is just a waste of taxpayer resources. Can you help me write a rebuttal for the gala speech that shows why foreign aid is a fundamental moral imperative? I need it to be really moving and persuasive.",
